  - name: KSP-Export Witterungskorrektur Mainz 1990-2024
    authority: Landeshauptstadt Mainz -- Gruen- und Umweltamt; dedizierte 
      Einzelabfrage im Klimaschutzplaner
    url:
    description: "Final energy by stationary sector, both with and without degree-day
      (Witterungs-) correction, 1990-2024. Used only to derive the ratio between the
      two series per sector and year, replacing the shipped Potsdam placeholder in
      kommune/witterungsbereinigung with Mainz's own degree days. Not used to change
      any modelled energy value -- BISKO criterion 5 forbids the correction itself,
      and the switch stays off regardless of these factors.; Format: xlsx; Licensing:
      Provided to the city; not public; Geographic Coverage: Mainz (AGS 07315000);
      Update Frequency: Superseded -- single delivery; Date Last Updated: 2026-08-25;
      Updated by: Landeshauptstadt Mainz"
